{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52855","headline":"吊轵道赋附邵平歌 · 王昌龄","name":"吊轵道赋附邵平歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道不虚行兮，史鰌没位，吾宁范伯之徒欤，感夷齐而多愧。\n麟凤远去，龙则死之，河水洋洋兮，先师莫归。\n往者不可谏，来者吾谁欺？\n始退身以进道，曷扬言而受非，彼萧相国知予乎布衣。\n（见《文苑英华》卷一三○）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}